      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MINI MATILDA (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (24.53) in a Grade 6/MDN at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Has ability and looks hard to stop. LITTLE HILL (1) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at this track over 407m behind Farmor Freedom (24.35) in a Maiden. Was in the money prior to that. Expected to feature in the finish. CANYA COVER GIRL (2) is on debut with a good inside draw a bonus. Among the leading players. GOLDEN ACE (7) makes debut for the Travis Elson kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Profiles nicely but market best guide to ability.",
